  "short_description": "<p>Handmade spun bamboo salad bowl set (1 bowl, spoon &amp; fork) – eco-friendly, food-safe, and ideal for sustainable dining. Made in Vietnam for wholesale buyers.</p>",
  "description": "<p data-start=\"344\" data-end=\"646\">This <strong data-start=\"349\" data-end=\"379\">spun bamboo salad bowl set</strong> includes one beautifully crafted bamboo bowl and a matching bamboo spoon and fork – all handmade by skilled artisans in Vietnam. Designed for natural living and sustainable dining, this eco-friendly set is perfect for salads, fruits, pasta, and buffet-style serving.</p>\n<p data-start=\"648\" data-end=\"895\">Each piece is made from layers of bamboo spun and shaped by hand, then polished and finished with food-safe coatings. The inner surface can be painted or left in natural tone, while the outer surface is customizable in various colors and patterns.</p>\n<p data-start=\"897\" data-end=\"1106\">As a leading <strong data-start=\"910\" data-end=\"951\">bamboo bowl manufacturer and exporter</strong> in Vietnam, we offer <strong data-start=\"973\" data-end=\"992\">OEM/ODM options</strong>, custom packaging, and wholesale prices for global distributors, brands, hotels, restaurants, and gift companies.</p>\n<figure id=\"attachment_745\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-745\" style=\"width: 612px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img loading=\"lazy\" class=\"size-medium wp-image-745\" src=\"https://vietcraft.vn/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/Vietnam-spun-bamboo-bowls-612x400.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"612\" height=\"400\" /><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-745\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Spun bamboo bowl manufacturer in Vietnam</figcaption></figure>\n<hr data-start=\"1108\" data-end=\"1111\" />\n<h2 data-start=\"1113\" data-end=\"1135\">✅ <strong data-start=\"1118\" data-end=\"1135\">Key Features:</strong></h2>\n<ul data-start=\"1136\" data-end=\"1447\">\n<li data-start=\"1136\" data-end=\"1191\">\n<p data-start=\"1138\" data-end=\"1191\">Set includes: 1 spun bamboo bowl + 1 spoon + 1 fork</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1192\" data-end=\"1229\">\n<p data-start=\"1194\" data-end=\"1229\">Handmade from 100% natural bamboo</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1230\" data-end=\"1273\">\n<p data-start=\"1232\" data-end=\"1273\">Lightweight, durable, and biodegradable</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1274\" data-end=\"1329\">\n<p data-start=\"1276\" data-end=\"1329\">Food-safe finishes (water-based or PU as requested)</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1330\" data-end=\"1383\">\n<p data-start=\"1332\" data-end=\"1383\">Customizable size, color, branding, and packaging</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1384\" data-end=\"1447\">\n<p data-start=\"1386\" data-end=\"1447\">Ideal for homes, hotels, restaurants, eco-stores, and gifts</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<hr data-start=\"1449\" data-end=\"1452\" />\n<h2 data-start=\"1454\" data-end=\"1481\">🌿 <strong data-start=\"1460\" data-end=\"1479\">Why It Matters:</strong></h2>\n<p data-start=\"1482\" data-end=\"1579\">This spun bamboo salad set represents more than function – it delivers cultural and social value:</p>\n<ul data-start=\"1581\" data-end=\"1813\">\n<li data-start=\"1581\" data-end=\"1634\">\n<p data-start=\"1583\" data-end=\"1634\"><strong data-start=\"1583\" data-end=\"1605\">Creates rural jobs</strong> during non-harvest seasons</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1635\" data-end=\"1683\">\n<p data-start=\"1637\" data-end=\"1683\"><strong data-start=\"1637\" data-end=\"1681\">Uses 100% Vietnamese materials and labor</strong></p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1684\" data-end=\"1744\">\n<p data-start=\"1686\" data-end=\"1744\"><strong data-start=\"1686\" data-end=\"1710\">Brings export income</strong> to support the national economy</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1745\" data-end=\"1813\">\n<p data-start=\"1747\" data-end=\"1813\"><strong data-start=\"1747\" data-end=\"1785\">Preserves traditional bamboo craft</strong> in a modern global market</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-start=\"1815\" data-end=\"1967\">At <strong data-start=\"1818\" data-end=\"1849\">Vietnam Handicraft Co., Ltd</strong>, we are proud to be your trusted <strong data-start=\"1883\" data-end=\"1932\">factory, manufacturer, and wholesale supplier</strong> for high-quality bamboo tableware.</p>\n<hr data-start=\"1969\" data-end=\"1972\" />\n<h2 data-start=\"1974\" data-end=\"2008\">✉️ <strong data-start=\"1980\" data-end=\"2006\">Contact for Wholesale:</strong></h2>\n<p data-start=\"2009\" data-end=\"2100\">📧 Email: <a class=\"cursor-pointer\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"2019\" data-end=\"2042\">vietcraft2006@gmail.com</a><br data-start=\"2042\" data-end=\"2045\" />🌐 Website: <a class=\"\" href=\"http://www.vietcraft.vn\" target=\"_new\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"2057\" data-end=\"2100\">www.vietcraft.vn</a></p>\n<p data-start=\"2146\" data-end=\"2303\">\n<p data-start=\"2338\" data-end=\"2490\">\n<p data-start=\"2516\" data-end=\"2735\">",
